Now imagine we want to send data from Controller → View.
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Example:

Controller has:

name = Sushmitha
age = 21

We want the HTML page to display:

Welcome Sushmitha
Your age is 21
---------------------------------------------------------------------
We need something to carry the data.

That's the Model.

model.addAttribute("name", name);
model.addAttribute("age", age);
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Example:

@GetMapping("/student")
public String student(Model model) {

    model.addAttribute("name", "Sushmitha");
    model.addAttribute("age", 21);

    return "student";
}
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Now:

Controller
     |
     | name = Sushmitha
     | age = 21
     ↓
   Model
     ↓
   View
